00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:42.967
Number 2: Schroeder gets some musical help from his feathered friends. 

00:05:45.511 --> 00:05:57.523
(Birds sing Beethoven's “Fur Elise”)

00:05:57.523 --> 00:05:58.775
What do you think,  Schroeder?

00:05:58.775 --> 00:06:00.485
(Birds singing continue)

00:06:00.485 --> 00:06:02.820
Well, the pitch is off. 

00:06:03.029 --> 00:06:04.906
Would Beethoven appreciate it?

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:06.991
I'm not sure.

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:09.160
But I certainly do.

00:06:10.078 --> 00:06:16.876
(Schroeder plays piano while birds sing)

00:06:20.296 --> 00:06:24.092
